1
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:20,839
Feng Zhiwei!

2
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:23,800
Ye Xuan!

3
00:00:24,719 --> 00:00:26,719
A disgusting monster

4
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,839
doesn't deserve to like me,

5
00:00:30,039 --> 00:00:31,399
nor to protect me!

6
00:00:33,119 --> 00:00:35,320
Gu Jiachen is gentle and kind.

7
00:00:35,359 --> 00:00:35,920
But you?

8
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,479
You are nothing!

9
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:40,560
You are rude and vulgar.

10
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,840
You can't compare to him at all.

11
00:00:42,719 --> 00:00:43,679
I'm so tired of

12
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,119
pretending to be nice to you.

13
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,439
Ye Xuan,

14
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:49,960
Give me back Gu Jiachen!

15
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,240
Give me back Gu Jiachen!

16
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:53,600
Give me back Gu Jiachen!

17
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:55,479
Give me back Gu Jiachen!

18
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,399
Yexuan, wake up!

19
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,320
Yexuan!

20
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:00,679
Yexuan!

21
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:03,679
No one cares about you in this world.

22
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:05,519
Draw your sword.

23
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,400
Let her kill you.

24
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,159
Then you'll be completely free.

25
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,159
Shut up!

26
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,040
Feng Zhiwei!

27
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,079
She's right.

28
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,640
No matter how hard I try,

29
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:21,200
you still don't like me.

30
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,120
Ye Xuan.

31
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,159
Ye Xuan.

32
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:28,920
Do you remember what I said?

33
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:31,239
Give me a chance

34
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,439
to save you.

35
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:35,799
It's too late to say anything now.

36
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,400
Feng Zhiwei.

37
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:40,519
No one can save me now.

38
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,439
Give me a chance

39
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:45,439
to save you.

40
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:48,680
Ye Xuan.

41
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,280
Feng Zhiwei.

42
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:53,120
I've always been happy.

43
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,439
Remember,

44
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:58,000
no matter who you are now,

45
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,799
you are unique

46
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,879
in this world.

47
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,039
Yue Xuan,

48
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:11,080
don't let others control you.

49
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,800
Remember who you are.

50
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:16,919
Don't be afraid.

51
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:20,520
You won't disappear.

52
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,199
Feng Zhiwei.

53
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:26,919
The heaven and earth are the witness.

54
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,960
The soul is the guide.

55
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,159
With my flesh and blood,

56
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,240
with my flesh and blood.

57
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,319
With my heart's blood,

58
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,879
I vow to forget the past.

59
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,199
Through countless reincarnation,

60
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,400
I wish you back.

61
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,840
Gu Jiachen, you're awake.

62
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:57,879
You slept pretty deeply.

63
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,439
Fu Yi.

64
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,039
Good afternoon.

65
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,360
I remember

66
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:10,000
my soul was about

67
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,800
to disappear.

68
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,319
If that's the case,

69
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,159
the souls of me and that guy

70
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:15,039
would have long disappeared.

71
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,519
But,

72
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:22,800
this is really the first time

73
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,920
we four are together.

74
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,160
How come none of you are dead?

75
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:41,560
That's because

76
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,360
Phoenix tricked us.

77
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:45,600
What's going on?

78
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,079
Tell us the truth.

79
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:48,920
Here's the thing...

80
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:50,800
Why did you

81
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:51,959
leave so soon?

82
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,759
What's going on?

83
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,319
Haven't you noticed

84
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,879
our souls

85
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:02,600
are merging?

86
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,560
[But once it happens,]

87
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,879
[there's no turning back]

88
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,920
[for the little phoenix.]

89
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,000
I think

90
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,800
I saw Fu Yi

91
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:21,800
and Gu Jiachen.

92
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:25,639
You...

93
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,399
What did you do?

94
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,600
I just learned a little spell

95
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,720
to make you more comfortable.

96
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,480
Don't worry.

97
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:41,920
Silly girl,

98
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,519
don't hurt yourself like this again.

99
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,680
Don't kill me.

100
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,360
Don't you have

101
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,160
soul separation syndrome?

102
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,920
I'm from Qinglou State.

103
00:06:08,079 --> 00:06:08,959
I have magic.

104
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,160
I can help you.

105
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,439
You have to believe me.

106
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:14,199
You... you ate my pills.

107
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:20,439
I...

108
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,439
I...

109
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,519
After it's done,

110
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,079
give me freedom.

111
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:35,639
How dare you!

112
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,120
I have 100,000 troops of the Helian tribe

113
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,759
outside the city.

114
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,519
If you...

115
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,160
Your Highness.

116
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,160
Do you think the Helian Tribe

117
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:44,959
will really obey your orders?

118
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,439
Those generals

119
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:48,079
just use you as a stepping stone.

120
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:49,959
As soon as you enter the city,

121
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:52,680
they can slaughter the city and establish themselves.

122
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:55,399
Just now,

123
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:56,920
His Highness asked me to take a team of people

124
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:58,920
to take them all

125
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:00,600
when they were not paying attention.

126
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:04,879
Do you think you won?

127
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:08,040
Yue Xuan is affected by the Soul-locking Formation.

128
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:10,399
He will be swallowed by the resentment sooner or later.

129
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:13,319
Then the Li Kingdom will be in chaos.

130
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:15,399
With the whole Li Kingdom buried with me,

131
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,480
I will be happy.

132
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,879
You are right.

133
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:20,120
Once the witch is dead,

134
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,920
no one can solve it.

135
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,639
But there is one thing you don't know.

136
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,639
The Soul-sealing Technique I used

137
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:28,560
was not meant to be solved.

138
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,800
The so-called Soul-sealing Technique

139
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,680
is just to repair

140
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,120
the vacancy of Yue Xuan's soul.

141
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,560
From now on,

142
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,360
no Soul-binding Art

143
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,000
can control him.

144
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,360
You lied to me!

145
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,560
All my efforts over the years

146
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,439
have come to nothing!

147
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,920
So what?

148
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:18,079
I have the ability,

149
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,759
but I'm still here.

150
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:24,199
If I have another chance,

151
00:08:24,759 --> 00:08:25,480
you

152
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,639
may not win.

153
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,120
I'll

154
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,559
wait for you

155
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,360
in hell.

156
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,639
How's the situation

157
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:02,360
of the Helian clan?

158
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,799
We just got a chance

159
00:09:05,279 --> 00:09:06,240
because they were leaderless.

160
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:09,519
If they realize it,

161
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,799
maybe...

162
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,360
Yexuan!

163
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,039
Yexuan!

164
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,000
Lady Feng,

165
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,799
don't worry about His Highness.

166
00:09:32,639 --> 00:09:33,559
The court-physicians are looking after him.

167
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,039
But

168
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,080
you look pale.

169
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,120
Are you alright?

170
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,039
I'm fine.

171
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,480
Maybe I'm just hungry.

172
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,240
Don't worry

173
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,240
about Ye Xuan.

174
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,759
Let him have a good sleep.

175
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,720
He'll be fine tomorrow.

176
00:09:56,679 --> 00:09:57,080
OK.

177
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,480
[Soul-binding Art,]

178
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,480
[uses the caster as a vessel,]

179
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:22,480
[to merge souls into one, undying and unbound.]

180
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:26,440
[Yet the caster's lifespan is shortened.]

181
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:31,320
[One day later, all traces in the world]

182
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,120
[will vanish into nothingness,]

183
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:36,200
[and the art is complete.]

184
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:58,360
Don't dwell on the past.

185
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,679
Jiu Zhuan Ling Long.

186
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,080
Gu Jiachen.

187
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,080
When it's dawn,

188
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:14,600
you'll be back.

189
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,600
Then you'll be

190
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,840
a healthy and whole person.

191
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,279
You don't have to worry

192
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,639
about your soul being split anymore.

193
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,399
Sister.

194
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:27,759
Long time no see.

195
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,120
Chen.

196
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,159
Why are you here?

197
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,200
Sister.

198
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,679
your hair has turned white.

199
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,120
I dyed it.

200
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:45,879
How do you like it?

201
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,159
Does it look good?

202
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,000
Sister,

203
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,159
is it worth

204
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,080
merging the four of us

205
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,879
into one complete soul?

206
00:11:58,799 --> 00:12:00,320
It's not about worth or not.

207
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:03,879
Tomorrow morning,

208
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,320
the four of us will become one.

209
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,440
We may never remember you,

210
00:12:11,759 --> 00:12:12,720
or Shen Li,

211
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,080
or Caiwei,

212
00:12:14,679 --> 00:12:15,960
everyone in the palace and outside,

213
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,080
they will all forget

214
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,279
the memories of being with you.

215
00:12:21,039 --> 00:12:22,240
But I won't forget.

216
00:12:22,879 --> 00:12:23,480
I will remember

217
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,440
everything about me.

218
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,600
Che,

219
00:12:26,159 --> 00:12:26,879
don't be sad.

220
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:29,200
The fortune teller said

221
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,639
one of us would die and the other would be hurt.

222
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:31,879
But look at us now,

223
00:12:31,919 --> 00:12:32,960
we are both alive and well.

224
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,159
It's already the greatest blessing.

225
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:40,960
Sister,

226
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:43,000
thank you

227
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,879
for never treating me as a monster.

228
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:48,120
I should be thanking you

229
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,679
for being willing to meet me six years ago.

230
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,000
Goodbye, sister.

231
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,279
Your Highness.

232
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:22,360
No, Your Majesty.

233
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:26,120
The Helian clan has been fully incorporated.

234
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,279
The five border cities

235
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,480
have been re-fortified.

236
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:30,279
The month-long journey

237
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,320
hasn't been in vain.

238
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:34,840
Shen Li,

239
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:37,440
you've been through a lot these days.

240
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,240
I'm not tired at all.

241
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,519
But you...

242
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:42,720
A month ago,

243
00:14:42,879 --> 00:14:44,039
you fell into a coma

244
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:44,759
in the basement of the Drunken Spring Breeze.

245
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,440
We were all worried about you.

246
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:48,919
Fortunately, the imperial physician said

247
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:50,000
your pulse was stable.

248
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:52,039
That's why we were relieved.

249
00:14:53,759 --> 00:14:54,559
I still can't figure out

250
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,440
what happened that day.

251
00:14:57,919 --> 00:14:59,159
I only remember that the witch

252
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,399
seemed to cast some spells.

253
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,679
Then I lost consciousness.

254
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:07,320
I guess the Soul-locking Formation

255
00:15:07,679 --> 00:15:08,720
was meant to control you,

256
00:15:09,559 --> 00:15:10,480
but it accidentally

257
00:15:10,799 --> 00:15:11,840
merged your personalities

258
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:12,519
into one.

259
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:15,279
It's a blessing in disguise.

260
00:15:16,519 --> 00:15:17,679
During Your Majesty's absence,

261
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,480
the palace has been well-managed,

262
00:15:20,919 --> 00:15:23,200
with all departments functioning smoothly.

263
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,240
There's another small matter.

264
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,399
Last month, the IG reported

265
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:31,279
that a discarded consort in the Cold Palace

266
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:32,679
had died of illness.

267
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,480
Cold Palace?

268
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:37,480
Yes.

269
00:15:37,879 --> 00:15:39,759
She was the princess

270
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:41,639
from Qingluan State six years ago.

271
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,039
She had been in the Cold Palace,

272
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,399
and no one cared about her.

273
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,720
When the palace people found her,

274
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,279
she was already dead.

275
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:51,399
The IG dealt with it as usual,

276
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,000
and sent her to the burial house outside.

277
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:55,879
I see.

278
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,720
What's the name

279
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,440
of that discarded consort?

280
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:01,960
I remember

281
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:04,759
her last name is Feng.

282
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,000
Feng?

283
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,000
Feng Zhiwei.

284
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,639
[Feng Zhiwei.]

285
00:16:25,559 --> 00:16:27,120
[It's my own decision.]

286
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,360
[I'm a little reluctant.]

287
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,559
[If forgetting me]

288
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:37,639
[can bring you peace,]

289
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:38,919
[it's a good deal.]

290
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,279
[Gu Jiachen.]

291
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,639
[Now you have]

292
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,879
[ended the war]

293
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,039
[and sat firmly on the throne.]

294
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:46,679
[It's time for me]

295
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,240
[to start my journey.]
